    LLM: 'A starting tile opens the layout. On each turn a player places one legal matching tile to an open end. If a player cannot move, the table profile determines whether they draw from a boneyard or pass. The hand ends when a player goes out or all players are blocked.',
    Player: 'A starting tile opens the layout. On each turn a player places one legal matching tile to an open end. If a player cannot move, the table profile determines whether they draw from a boneyard or pass. The hand ends when a player goes out or all players are blocked.',
